<title>GREECE: MORE BROKERS JOIN TRADE, OFFICIAL LIST AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>MORE BROKERS JOIN TRADE, OFFICIAL LIST AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>More Athens stock exchange members had joined trading at the Athens bourse with the number rising to about 40, sources said. The exchange was expected to provide an official list at the close. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
